{{!
    @template mod_choicegroup/enrollment_conditions

    The minimum and maximum number of groups a student must choose, shown above the table layout.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * message - the condition (plain)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "message": "You must enroll in between 2 and 3 groups"
    }
}}
<strong>{{#str}}enrollmentconditions, choicegroup{{/str}}: </strong>{{message}}
